 1301     GO TO LOCS <15.  IF WANDERING AT RANDOM, THEY DON'T BACK            
 1302     UP UNLESS THERE'S NO ALTERNATIVE.  IF THEY DON'T HAVE TO            
 1303     MOVE, THEY ATTACK.  AND, OF COURSE, DEAD DWARFS DON'T DO            
 1304     MUCH OF ANYTHING.                                                   
