 1805                                                                         
 1806     GIVEN THE CURRENT LOCATION IN "LOC", AND A MOTION VERB              
 1807     NUMBER IN "K", PUT THE NEW LOCATION IN "NEWLOC".  THE               
 1808     CURRENT LOC IS SAVED IN "OLDLOC" IN CASE HE WANTS TO                
 1809     RETREAT.  THE CURRENT OLDLOC IS SAVED IN OLDLC2, IN CASE            
 1810     HE DIES.  (IF HE DOES, NEWLOC WILL BE LIMBO, AND OLDLOC             
 1811     WILL BE WHAT KILLED HIM, SO WE NEED OLDLC2, WHICH IS THE            
