 3078     NOW LOOK AT HOW HE FINISHED AND HOW FAR HE GOT.  MAXDIE             
 3079     AND NUMDIE TELL US HOW WELL HE SURVIVED.  GAVEUP SAYS               
 3080     WHETHER HE EXITED VIA QUIT.  DFLAG WILL TELL US IF HE               
