 3588                                                                         
 3589  /*                                                                     
 3590     PUT IS THE SAME AS MOVE, EXCEPT IT RETURNS A VALUE USED             
 3591     TO SET UP THE NEGATED PROP VALUES FOR THE REPOSITORY                
 3592     OBJECTS.                                                            
 3593  */                                                                     
 3594                                                                         
 3595          CALL MOVE(OBJECT,WHERE);                                       
 3596          RETURN((-1)-PVAL);                                             
