 3714          2       TOO MANY WORDS OF MESSAGES                             
 3715          3       TOO MANY TRAVEL OPTIONS                                
 3716          4       TOO MANY VOCABULARY WORDS                              
 3717          5       REQUIRED VOCABULARY WORD NOT FOUND                     
 3718          6       TOO MANY RTEXT OR MTEXT MESSAGES                       
 3719          7       TOO MANY HINTS                                         
 3720          8       LOCATION HAS COND BIT BEING SET TWICE                  
 3721          9       INVALID SECTION NUMBER IN DATABASE                     
 3722         10       END OF FILE RAISED FOR DATABASE                        
 3723         20       SPECIAL TRAVEL (500>L>300) EXCEEDS GOTO LIST           
 3724         21       RAN OFF END OF VOCABULARY TABLE                        
 3725         22       VOCABULARY TYPE (N/1000) NOT BETWEEN 0 AND 3           
